iner of windows.",["tmux Cheat Sheet","Quick reference terms"]],["tmux/Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-4525","Window: Like a tab; contains one or more panes.",["tmux Cheat Sheet","Quick reference terms"]],["tmux/Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-4581","Pane: A split region within a window (runs a shell/program).",["tmux Cheat Sheet","Quick reference terms"]],["tmux/Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-4650","Client: A terminal attached to a session.",["tmux Cheat Sheet","Quick reference terms"]],["tmux/Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-4700","Server: Background process managing sessions.",["tmux Cheat Sheet","Quick reference terms"]],["tmux/Command/choose-tree/","source-block-47","tmux choose-tree [-GhikNrswyZ] [-F format] [-f filter] [-K key-format] [-O sort-order] [-t target-pane] [template]",[]],["tmux/Command/choose-tree/","source-block-220","Put a pane into tmux/Mode/Tree, where a tmux/session, tmux/Window, or tmux/Pane may be chosen from a hierarchy.",["tmux choose-tree [-GhikNrswyZ] [-F format] [-f filter] [-K key-format] [-O sort-order] [-t target-pane] [template]"]],["tmux/Command/choose-tree/","source-block-351","-s starts with sessions collapsed; -w starts with windows collapsed; -Z zooms the pane; and -y disables confirmation prompts.",["tmux choose-tree [-GhikNrswyZ] [-F format] [-f filter] [-K key-format] [-O sort-order] [-t target-pane] [template]"]],["tmux/Command/choose-tree/","source-block-488","Given neither -s nor -w, every branch starts open down to the panes, so choose-tree -Z is the fully expanded picker.",["tmux choose-tree [-GhikNrswyZ] [-F format] [-f filter] [-K key-format] [-O sort-order] [-t target-pane] [template]"]],["tmux/Command/choose-tree/","source-block-614","The flags also bound how far expand-all goes. Under -s or -w, M-+ never opens a window, so it reveals the windows after -s and changes nothing after -w; panes are reached one window at a time. Without either flag it restores the whole tree, panes included.",["tmux choose-tree [-GhikNrswyZ] [-F format] [-f filter] [-K key-format] [-O sort-order] [-t target-pane] [template]"]]],"format_version":5}